Comment: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:02.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}Myao
Comment: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:08.21,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}ありえない...
Comment: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:11.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}規格外
Comment: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.28,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}たまらない
Comment: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:20.17,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}出会いはそう　偶然のキャットウォーク
Comment: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:23.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}吸い込まれる　瞳の奥 BlackHole
Comment: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.24,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}ツンでデレで派手に詰んだ
Comment: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:27.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}この胸の高鳴り何だ？？
Comment: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}午後は雨みたいだから
Comment: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:36.12,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}早めのランチどうかな
Comment: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:39.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}ばっちばちに日向ぼっこ
Comment: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:42.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}なんだこの天使
Comment: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:46.40,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}ずっと　僕は君のもんだ
Comment: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:49.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}最愛すぎて　時空歪んだ
Comment: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:53.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}気がつけば　君こそがユニバース
Comment: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:54.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}ドックンバックンで
Comment: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:55.78,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}もはや　つらい...
Comment: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:58.95,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}運命だって奇跡だって
Comment: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:02.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}キミと出会えたのはビッグバン
Comment: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:05.95,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空に浮かぶ星はMiracle
Comment: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:09.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}無償の愛にエゴはいらない
Comment: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.95,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}ただそばにいたいんだ...
