Comment: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:00.80,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵  喵  喵  喵  喵
Comment: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:02.43,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵
Comment: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:08.21,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}太不可思议了...
Comment: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:11.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}太超模了
Comment: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.28,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}令人无法抗拒
Comment: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:20.17,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}在狭窄的道路上  我们巧合地相遇了
Comment: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:23.19,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}立马就被你那黑洞一样的深邃眼神所吸引
Comment: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.24,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}你的冷漠、温柔和夸张
Comment: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:27.26,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}为何会让我心跳不已呢？？
Comment: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.86,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}下午可能会下雨
Comment: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:36.12,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}不如提前去吃午饭吧
Comment: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:39.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}在阳光下尽情享受着日光浴
Comment: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:42.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}这小可爱到底是何方神圣
Comment: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:46.40,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}从今往后  我都是属于你的了
Comment: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:49.48,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}过度的深爱  让时空也扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:53.38,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}不知不觉间  你已经成为了我的宇宙
Comment: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:54.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}怦怦直跳心情
Comment: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:55.78,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}让我倍感煎熬...
Comment: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:58.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}说是命运也好  奇迹也罢
Comment: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:02.02,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}我们的相遇就是宇宙大爆炸
Comment: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:05.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空中悬挂的星星就是奇迹
Comment: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:09.03,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}纯然的爱不需要自我
Comment: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}我只想一直陪在你的身边...
